Z||000000||Zorba||12-05-2000||12:31 AM||||Can anyone share the best deal on rear brake calipers for an 84-87 and if you have found the piston turning tool to help install the new pads. Idea on $$$$. Thanks.<BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Carrolles||12-05-2000||06:27 AM||||AutoZone has remanufactured ones for around $32 US with an $80 refundable core charge.||||reg||1
